+/* Porthole (Cycles on Metal), slot 171: GPU binaries built ahead of time for this GPU (Apple's metal-tt), so a pipeline needs no compile on the device (the system's compiler
+ * service is stopped by the biggest Cycles kernels on a phone). bytes/length: the archive file; NULL replaces nothing and only asks the GPU's architecture name. arch_out (32 bytes,
+ * optional) receives the architecture name of the device (for example "applegpu_g16p"). Returns 1 when the archive was loaded and is now the one pipelines with flag bit 1 use. */
